"K1238269319" "Solitude, they told me.  Secrecy.  Easy assignment.  Just transport Villains back and forth under the Peregrine Island radar.  Not a bad job.  They didn't tell me I'd never catch any fish.  This sucks."
"K1282518565" "Hope you find what you're looking for, {VillainName}."
"K1553432696" "I tell 'em over and over again about the Devouring Earth.  I say, 'They're not easy.  Might wanna bring a friend or two.'  Do they listen?  No.  Is my breath wasted?  Yes.  You'd THINK they'd have some respect for all I do, considering I take the time to get them over here just under the radar of those Heroes.  You'd THINK."
"K169789119" "I tell them over and over again, 'go fight something.  I'm fishing.'  Do they listen?  No."
"K222949680" "And so I said, 'You MIGHT want to be careful.  Those Devouring Earth are nasty.  That's all I'm sayin'.'  And they ask more questions.  Aren't these Villains supposed to be smart?  I mean, they've been around the block a few times.  What part of 'That's all I'm sayin'' is confusing?"
"K254445294" "They don't call them 'Devouring' Earth for nothing.  Hee hee, little fishie, did you see that guy get all gobbled up by one?  I did.  It was better than cable."
"K2720758138" "Huh.  Well they DID say if I remained on solitary orders for any length of time, I'd start talking to myself.  Guess they were right.  Nuts.  I need more bait."
"K3054494946" "I'll never understand why those high Threat-Level Villains can't understand the phrase, 'off duty'.  Is it so hard to understand?  Do they not see the fishing pole in my hand?"
"K4137293055" "Well the fishing WAS good."
"K576282762" "Those Rikti Monkeys are pests.  All that hippity hoppity is ruining my fishing experience."
"K828532239" "Off-Duty Arachnos"
